---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SUPPORT_EMAIL } from '../config';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — AtLeast"
  description="AtLeast runs timer logic on-device. The website, iPhone app, and Apple Watch app use cookieless Plausible analytics—no accounts, no advertising, no cross-app tracking."
>
  <section class="px-6 py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
      <h1 class="mb-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mb-12 text-sm text-brand-muted">Last updated: August 2026</p>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-muted">
        <p>
          <em>AtLeast</em> is privacy-first. There are no accounts. Session and haptic logic run on your devices. We use limited, cookieless analytics on the website, iPhone app, and Apple Watch app—nothing for advertising or cross-app tracking.
        </p>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-brand-text">What stays on-device</h2>
          <p>
            Timer settings stay on your devices and are not uploaded as an account or personal profile. Session and haptic logic run locally on the watch. Starting a session also sends limited configuration via analytics (see below)—never for advertising.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-brand-text">Analytics</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            We use <a href="https://plausible.io/" class="text-brand-accent underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Plausible</a>, a privacy-friendly analytics service that does not use cookies or persistent identifiers and is not used for advertising or cross-app or cross-site tracking.
          </p>
          <ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-1">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-brand-text">Website:</strong> page analytics for atleast.app; outbound-link clicks; custom events <code class="text-sm">Nav: UseCases click</code> (<code class="text-sm">variant</code>) and <code class="text-sm">TestFlight: Click</code> (<code class="text-sm">variant</code>, <code class="text-sm">location</code>)
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-brand-text">iPhone and Apple Watch apps:</strong> cookieless events via AviaryInsights (a Plausible client) on both platforms—
              a launch event (<code class="text-sm">ios_open</code>) with a <code class="text-sm">watch_paired</code> property on iPhone;
              <code class="text-sm">pageview</code> screen views across app screens;
              and <code class="text-sm">session_start</code> on each watch session with <code class="text-sm">duration_seconds</code>, <code class="text-sm">tap_interval_seconds</code>, <code class="text-sm">haptic_config</code>, and <code class="text-sm">preloaded_from_phone</code>.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-brand-text">What we do not collect</h2>
          <ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-1">
            <li>No accounts or sign-in</li>
            <li>No crash reporting sent off-device</li>
            <li>No personal identifiers or advertising IDs</li>
            <li>No location data</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-brand-text">Third parties</h2>
          <p>
            Plausible provides analytics for the website and for the iPhone and Apple Watch apps (via AviaryInsights). <em>AtLeast</em> has no advertising SDKs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-brand-text">Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about this policy? Email us at
            <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`} class="text-brand-accent underline">
              {SUPPORT_EMAIL}
            </a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
